@baseUrl = http://localhost:8500/fhir

### Server capabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/metadata
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Code F from HL7 v2 table 0001
GET {{baseUrl}}/CodeSystem/$lookup?system=http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0001&code=F
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Available FHIR genders
GET {{baseUrl}}/ValueSet/$expand?url=http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/administrative-gender
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Translate F -> female, as in the FML
POST {{baseUrl}}/ConceptMap/$translate
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType": "Parameters",
  "parameter": [
    { "name": "url", "valueUri": "http://example.org/fml-demo/ConceptMap/v2-sex-to-gender" },
    { "name": "system", "valueUri": "http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v2-0001" },
    { "name": "code", "valueCode": "F" }
  ]
}
